{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1321114001:1":{"text":"老板娘！你觉得白山公国哪里最让人向往？","source_cn":"老板娘！你觉得白山公国哪里最让人向往？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E3F8334CD89E52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321114002:1":{"text":"论起最让人向往的东西，肯定是我家的美食。但最让人向往的地方嘛……","source_cn":"论起最让人向往的东西，肯定是我家的美食。但最让人向往的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1ECCBD6D110902D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321114003:1":{"text":"镇上来来往往这么多人，凭我的观察，要么是<style=\"highlight\">繁花原野</style>，要么就是<style=\"highlight\">充满祭典氛围的雪松镇</style>！","source_cn":"镇上来来往往这么多人，凭我的观察，要么是<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6094C60F88F1D5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321114004:1":{"text":"当然，等祭典结束以后，雪松镇的吸引力就没那么大了，还是花海和温泉更受欢迎——不过，我家的美食绝对比白熊温泉旅店更好！","source_cn":"当然，等祭典结束以后，雪松镇的吸引力就没那么大了，还是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F3168F1C419E4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321114005:1":{"text":"花海和雪松镇……我知道了，谢谢！","source_cn":"花海和雪松镇……我知道了，谢谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEA401B78A585349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_reco